Full schema for all tables:

headquarter: ID_headquarter (PK), name_headquarter, address

department: ID_department (PK), name_department, ID_headquarter (FK)

subject: ID_subject (PK), name_subject, number_of_credit

teacher: ID_teacher (PK), name_teacher, degree, address_teacher, phone_teacher, gender_teacher, ID_department (FK)

student: ID_student (PK), name_student, date_of_birth, gender_student, address_student, phone_student, year_of_admission, ID_department (FK), ID_curriculum (FK)

room: ID_room (PK), name_room, capacity, ID_headquarter (FK)

term: ID_term (PK), name_term, year_start, term_no, start_date, end_date, reg_open, reg_close

timeslot: ID_timeslot (PK), shift_no, start_time, end_time

class: ID_class (PK), ID_subject (FK), ID_teacher (FK), ID_term (FK), group_number, min_students, max_students, number_of_registration (default 0), class_status (default 'OPEN')

session: ID_session (PK), study_date, day_of_week, note, ID_class (FK), ID_room (FK), ID_timeslot (FK)

registration: ID_registration (PK), ID_student (FK), ID_class (FK), registered_at (default getdate()), cancelled_at (nullable), registration_status (default 'REGISTERED')

curriculum: ID_curriculum (PK), curriculum_name, total_credits_required

curriculum_subject: ID_curriculum (PK, FK), ID_subject (PK, FK), is_required (1=bắt buộc, 0=tự chọn)

prerequisite: ID_subject (PK, FK), ID_prereq_subject (PK, FK), min_grade, note

## System Features & API Routes


### Authentication
- POST /api/auth/login → { token, role, ID_headquarter, ID_user }
- Roles: 'sinhvien' | 'giangvien' | 'nhanvien' | 'quantrivien'
- Every route requires JWT header: Authorization: Bearer <token>
- Routes are filtered by role + ID_headquarter from token payload

---

### 1. Quản lý cơ sở đào tạo (quantrivien only, node HQHD)
- GET    /api/coso              → list all headquarter
- GET    /api/coso/:id          → detail
- POST   /api/coso              → create
- PUT    /api/coso/:id          → update
- DELETE /api/coso/:id          → delete

---

### 2. Quản lý sinh viên (nhanvien + quantrivien)
- GET    /api/sinhvien                    → list (filtered by ID_headquarter from token)
- GET    /api/sinhvien/:id               → detail
- POST   /api/sinhvien                   → create (insert into local node)
- PUT    /api/sinhvien/:id               → update
- DELETE /api/sinhvien/:id               → delete
Node routing: always query node matching student's ID_headquarter

---

### 3. Quản lý giảng viên (nhanvien + quantrivien)
- GET    /api/giangvien                  → list (filtered by ID_headquarter)
- GET    /api/giangvien/:id             → detail
- POST   /api/giangvien                 → create
- PUT    /api/giangvien/:id             → update
- DELETE /api/giangvien/:id             → delete
Node routing: always query node matching teacher's department → headquarter

---

### 4. Quản lý học phần / môn học (quantrivien only, node HQHD — replicated)
- GET    /api/hocphan            → list all subject (read from any node, replicated)
- GET    /api/hocphan/:id        → detail
- POST   /api/hocphan            → create (write to HQHD only, replication pushes to others)
- PUT    /api/hocphan/:id        → update (HQHD only)
- DELETE /api/hocphan/:id        → delete (HQHD only)
Tables: subject, curriculum, curriculum_subject, prerequisite, term, timeslot

---

### 5. Quản lý lớp học phần (nhanvien + quantrivien)
- GET    /api/lophocphan                        → list classes (filter by ID_headquarter, ID_term)
- GET    /api/lophocphan/:id                    → detail with enrolled count
- POST   /api/lophocphan                        → create class (insert into local node)
- PUT    /api/lophocphan/:id                    → update (change teacher, max_students, status)
- DELETE /api/lophocphan/:id                    → delete
- PUT    /api/lophocphan/:id/status             → open/close class (class_status = 'OPEN'|'CLOSED')
Node routing: class belongs to node of teacher → department → headquarter

---

### 6. Quản lý phòng học và lịch học (nhanvien + quantrivien)
- GET    /api/phonghoc                          → list rooms (filter by ID_headquarter)
- POST   /api/phonghoc                          → create room
- PUT    /api/phonghoc/:id                      → update
- DELETE /api/phonghoc/:id                      → delete

- GET    /api/lichhoc/:id_class                 → list sessions of a class
- POST   /api/lichhoc                           → create session (triggers trg_check_room_capacity)
- PUT    /api/lichhoc/:id                       → update session
- DELETE /api/lichhoc/:id                       → delete session
Node routing: room and session stored on local node (room.ID_headquarter)

---

### 7. Đăng ký học phần (sinhvien only)
- GET    /api/dangky/available?ID_term=...      → list OPEN classes available to register
                                                   (includes classes from all 3 nodes)
- POST   /api/dangky                            → register
  Body: { ID_student, ID_class, ID_headquarter_sv, ID_headquarter_lop }
  Logic:
    if ID_headquarter_sv === ID_headquarter_lop:
      → local: call usp_RegisterClass on student's node
    else:
      → cross-campus 2PC:
          Phase 1: usp_CheckRegisterCondition on both nodes
          Phase 2: usp_RegisterClass on student's node
                 + UPDATE number_of_registration on class's node
          Rollback both on failure
  Triggers auto-fire: trg_check_duplicate_subject_registration,
                      trg_check_schedule_conflict,
                      trg_check_class_capacity

---

### 8. Hủy đăng ký học phần (sinhvien only)
- DELETE /api/dangky/:ID_registration
  Body: { ID_headquarter_sv }
  Logic: call usp_CancelRegistration on student's node
         → sets status = 'CANCELLED', decrements number_of_registration

---

### 9. Tra cứu kết quả đăng ký
- GET /api/dangky/result?ID_student=...&ID_headquarter=...
  → call usp_GetRegistrationResult on student's node
  → returns: mã lớp, tên học phần, số TC, học kỳ, giảng viên, trạng thái

- GET /api/thoikhoabieu?ID_student=...&ID_headquarter=...
  → call usp_GetStudentTimetable on student's node
  → returns: ngày học, thứ, ca, giờ, phòng, cơ sở học, giảng viên

---

### 10. Thống kê (nhanvien xem cơ sở mình, quantrivien xem tất cả)
- GET /api/thongke/lophocphan?ID_term=...&ID_headquarter=...
  → call usp_StatsClassRegistrationByTerm
  → returns per-class: sĩ số, số đăng ký, tỷ lệ lấp đầy

- GET /api/thongke/sinhvien-theo-coso?ID_headquarter=...
  → call usp_StatsRegisteredStudentsByCampus on HQHD node
  → returns count of registered students per campus

- GET /api/thongke/dangky-cheo
  → call usp_CheckCrossCampusRegistration on HQHD node (quantrivien only)
  → returns all cross-campus registrations

- GET /api/admin/node-status
  → ping all 3 nodes, return { HQHD: 'online'|'offline', HQHL: ..., HQHCM: ... }

---

### Node routing summary:
- Read replicated data (subject, term, timeslot, curriculum): any node (prefer local)
- Write replicated data: HQHD only
- Student/registration/teacher/class/room/session: route to node by ID_headquarter
- Cross-campus registration: 2PC across student's node + class's node
- Stats toàn trường: always HQHD node

### Error response format:
{ success: false, message: 'Lý do lỗi', node: 'HQHL' }

### Success response format:
{ success: true, data: [...] }


## Stored Procedures & Triggers (already implemented in SQL Server)

### Triggers (on registration table, auto-fire on INSERT/UPDATE):
- trg_check_duplicate_subject_registration — blocks registering 2 classes of same subject in same term
- trg_check_schedule_conflict — blocks registering classes with overlapping session schedule
- trg_check_class_capacity — blocks registration if number_of_registration > max_students
- trg_check_room_capacity — (on session table) blocks session insert if class.max_students > room.capacity

### Stored Procedures:
1. usp_CheckRegisterCondition(@ID_student, @ID_class, @ID_headquarter = NULL)
   → Returns: { is_valid: 0|1, message: string }
   → Checks: student exists, class is OPEN, within reg_open/reg_close, not duplicate, no schedule conflict, not full

2. usp_RegisterClass(@ID_registration, @ID_student, @ID_class, @ID_headquarter = NULL)
   → Registers student to class inside a transaction
   → Uses UPDLOCK + ROWLOCK on class to prevent race condition
   → Increments number_of_registration
   → Throws: 50001 (student not found), 50002 (class not open), 50003 (duplicate), 50004 (schedule conflict), 50005 (full)

3. usp_CancelRegistration(@ID_registration, @ID_headquarter = NULL)
   → Sets registration_status = 'CANCELLED', sets cancelled_at = GETDATE()
   → Decrements number_of_registration
   → Uses UPDLOCK + ROWLOCK

4. usp_GetRegistrationResult(@ID_student = NULL, @ID_headquarter = NULL)
   → Returns full registration list with: mã cơ sở, tên SV, mã lớp, tên học phần, số TC, học kỳ, giảng viên, trạng thái
   → If @ID_student NULL → returns all; filtered by @ID_headquarter if provided

5. usp_GetStudentTimetable(@ID_student = NULL, @ID_headquarter = NULL)
   → Returns timetable: ngày học, thứ, ca học, giờ bắt đầu/kết thúc, phòng học, cơ sở học, giảng viên
   → Only REGISTERED registrations

6. usp_StatsClassRegistrationByTerm(@ID_term, @ID_headquarter = NULL)
   → Returns per-class stats: sĩ số tối đa, số đã đăng ký, tỷ lệ lấp đầy (%), trạng thái lớp

7. usp_CheckCrossCampusRegistration()
   → Returns all registrations where student's campus ≠ class's campus (cross-campus cases)
   → Campus of class determined via teacher → department → headquarter

8. usp_StatsRegisteredStudentsByCampus(@ID_headquarter = NULL)
   → Returns count of distinct registered students per campus

## How backend calls Stored Procedures (Node.js + mssql):
```js
// Example: call usp_RegisterClass
const pool = await getPool(nodeKey);
const result = await pool.request()
  .input('ID_registration', sql.VarChar(20), id_reg)
  .input('ID_student', sql.VarChar(20), id_student)
  .input('ID_class', sql.VarChar(20), id_class)
  .input('ID_headquarter', sql.VarChar(20), id_hq)
  .execute('usp_RegisterClass');
```

## Registration status values:
- 'REGISTERED' — active registration
- 'CANCELLED' — cancelled (cancelled_at is set)

## Cross-campus registration (2PC pattern):
- Student's campus ≠ class's campus → need both nodes online
- Phase 1: call usp_CheckRegisterCondition on BOTH nodes
- Phase 2: call usp_RegisterClass on student's node (inserts registration)
           + UPDATE number_of_registration on class's node
- On any failure: rollback both transactions

## Campus determination logic:
- Student's campus: student → department → headquarter
- Class's campus: class → teacher → department → headquarter
- Used in: cross-campus detection, @ID_headquarter filtering in all procedures


